Note on per-file headers
------------------------
Source files carry no added SPDX headers. Every exported file in this
repository has the content of the project export (line endings normalised to
LF), and the accompanying article reproduces excerpts verbatim, so inserting
licence headers would break both. The two SysML files additionally carry the
three attributes the completion overlay records (changeoverPeriod,
saturationTimeConstant, minDecontaminationFactor), pending re-export. Licensing is
therefore declared in LICENSE and this file.

